<PageTitle>EOQuoter internal viewer</PageTitle>

<h1>EOQuoter internal viewer</h1>
<p class="muted">Two separated streams, two views — by design.</p>

<ul>
    <li>
        <a href="/audit"><b>Decision audit</b></a> — rating ledgers, eligibility outcomes, bind/issue
        events, reconciliation results. Keyed by quote/policy/external ref: pull one risk, see every
        decision and dollar that touched it.
    </li>
    <li>
        <a href="/ops"><b>Operations</b></a> — batch job status, sproc execution log (from the separate
        tracking DB), rejects, dead letters. Operator-facing.
    </li>
</ul>
